@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam dpi 150
hide empty members
legend bottom
Todos los value objects carecen de identidad y son inmutables.
Se validan al construirlos; una modificación crea un nuevo valor.
La igualdad compara sus atributos, salvo Timestamp (instante UTC).
CalendarDate representa una fecha válida sin hora ni zona horaria.
endlegend
title SkyCrop - Gestión de Usuarios, Autenticación y Suscripciones
abstract class User  {
-id: Long
-name: Name
-email: EmailAddress
-createdAt: Timestamp
+register(): void
+updateProfile(): void
}
class UserProfile  {
-id: Long
-phone: PhoneNumber [0..1]
-address: PostalAddress [0..1]
+updateInformation(): void
}
class Subscription  {
-id: Long
-period: SubscriptionPeriod
-type: SubscriptionType
-status: SubscriptionStatus
+activate(): void
+renew(): void
+cancel(): void
+isActive(): boolean
+hasFeature(feature: String): boolean
}
class Farmer  {

+managePlots(): void
+manageDrones(): void
+viewReports(): void
}
class Agronomist  {
-professionalLicense: String
+analyzeCrop(): void
+managePlots(): void
+generateReport(): void
}
class Payment  {
-id: Long
-amount: Money
-paymentDate: Timestamp
-method: PaymentMethod
-status: PaymentStatus
+initiate(): void
+authorize(): boolean
+reject(): void
+refund(): void
}
interface PaymentProcessor  {

+process(payment: Payment): boolean
+authorize(payment: Payment): boolean
}
class Account  {
-id: Long
-username: String
-passwordHash: String
-status: AccountStatus
+create(): void
+authenticate(): boolean
+deactivate(): void
}
interface AuthenticationService  {

+authenticate(account: Account): boolean
+verifyTwoFactor(code: String): boolean
+recoverAccount(code: String): boolean
}
interface EmailService  {

+sendVerificationCode(email: EmailAddress): void
+sendRecoveryCode(email: EmailAddress): void
}
class TwoFactorAuthentication  {
-id: Long
-enabled: boolean
-verifiedAt: Timestamp [0..1]
+generateCode(): String
+verify(code: String): boolean
}
class RecoveryCode  {
-id: Long
-code: String
-used: boolean
-expiresAt: Timestamp
+generate(): String
+validate(): boolean
+use(): void
}
enum SubscriptionStatus {
ACTIVE
EXPIRED
CANCELLED
PENDING
}
enum SubscriptionType {
BASIC
PROFESSIONAL
COOPERATIVE
}
enum PaymentMethod {
CARD
TRANSFER
OTHER
}
enum PaymentStatus {
PENDING
AUTHORIZED
REJECTED
REFUNDED
}
enum AccountStatus {
ACTIVE
INACTIVE
LOCKED
}
class EmailAddress <<value object>> {
-value: String {readOnly}

}
class Money <<value object>> {
-amount: Decimal {readOnly}
-currency: String {readOnly}
+add(other: Money): Money
+subtract(other: Money): Money
}
note right of Money
Inmutable; igualdad por amount y currency.
add/subtract requieren la misma moneda
y devuelven un nuevo Money.
end note
User <|-- Farmer
User <|-- Agronomist
User "1" *-- "1" UserProfile : has
User "1" -- "0..*" Subscription : subscribes
User "1" *-- "1" Account : owns
Subscription "1" *-- "0..*" Payment : contains
Subscription --> SubscriptionStatus : status
Subscription --> SubscriptionType : type
Payment --> PaymentMethod : method
Payment --> PaymentStatus : status
PaymentProcessor ..> Payment : processes
Account --> AccountStatus : status
Account "1" -- "0..1" TwoFactorAuthentication : uses
Account "1" -- "0..*" RecoveryCode : has
AuthenticationService ..> Account : authenticates
AuthenticationService ..> TwoFactorAuthentication : verifies
AuthenticationService ..> RecoveryCode : recovers
EmailService ..> TwoFactorAuthentication : sends code
EmailService ..> RecoveryCode : sends code
EmailService ..> EmailAddress
User "1" *-- "1" EmailAddress : email
Payment "1" *-- "1" Money : amount
class Name <<value object>> {
-value: String {readOnly}
}
note right of Name
Texto no vacío después de quitar espacios externos.
Conserva caracteres y escritura del nombre.
Sin exigir cantidad de palabras.
end note
class Timestamp <<value object>> {
-value: DateTimeOffset {readOnly}
}
note right of Timestamp
Instante válido con desplazamiento horario.
Igualdad y comparación por instante UTC.
end note
User "1" *-- "1" Name : name
User ..> Timestamp : temporal values
Payment ..> Timestamp : temporal values
TwoFactorAuthentication ..> Timestamp : temporal values
RecoveryCode ..> Timestamp : temporal values
class PhoneNumber <<value object>> {
-value: String {readOnly}
}
note right of PhoneNumber
Representación internacional: + y hasta 15 dígitos.
Sin espacios ni separadores en el valor almacenado.
La sintaxis no comprueba la titularidad del número.
end note
class PostalAddress <<value object>> {
-value: String {readOnly}
}
note right of PostalAddress
Dirección textual no vacía, sin espacios externos.
Sin exigir código postal o una distribución fija.
end note
class CalendarDate <<value object>> {
-value: Date {readOnly}
}
class SubscriptionPeriod <<value object>> {
-startDate: CalendarDate {readOnly}
-endDate: CalendarDate {readOnly}
+contains(date: CalendarDate): boolean
}
note right of SubscriptionPeriod
Fechas válidas; endDate > startDate.
Intervalo [startDate, endDate).
renew sustituye el período por un nuevo valor.
end note
UserProfile "1" *-- "0..1" PhoneNumber : phone
UserProfile "1" *-- "0..1" PostalAddress : address
Subscription "1" *-- "1" SubscriptionPeriod : period
SubscriptionPeriod "1" *-- "2" CalendarDate : boundaries
note bottom of TwoFactorAuthentication
verifiedAt puede estar ausente antes de la verificación.
RecoveryCode expira cuando now >= expiresAt.
end note
@enduml
